        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Always clean and well organized, selection is pretty good in all departments. This store however, is expensive than most other grocery stores but very conveniently located and thankfully easy access from the direction we come from. Had an excellent customer service. Overall.. shopping experience is ok.\n\nIf you want to save a lot more, a 5 min drive west down 5th ave to Pincourt, You'll find Maxi and SuperC right next to each other. Better prices.",
