        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Many would say, \"An IGA is an IGA.\"\n\nWell this IGA is a level above other IGA's!\n\nHaving shopped at this IGA on many occasions I'm always impressed by the cleanliness of the store, the friendliness of the staff and the vast selection. Shopping at this IGA location has a European feel, which I like.",
        "time": 1697210153,
        "translated": false
